# =============================================================================
# Blood Bank Management System — CLIENT (React + Vite) environment template
# =============================================================================
# HOW TO USE
#   1. Copy this file:   cp .env.example .env
#   2. Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.
#   3. .env is read at BUILD time. Changing it requires restarting `npm run dev`
#      or rebuilding (`npm run build`) — values are baked into the bundle.
#   4. NEVER put secrets here — everything in a VITE_ var ships to the browser.
# =============================================================================

# Backend API base URL.
#
# [DEV]  Local backend:
VITE_APP_URI_API=http://localhost:5000
#
# [PROD] Public API host (behind Nginx). Comment the dev line above and use:
# VITE_APP_URI_API=https://system.sanjivanibloodbank.org
